{"id": "en-r-b3n4or.en", "jokeId": "en-r-b3n4or", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Lines kept verbatim from the previous version (voice-over reused). Restaged per user note: pilots walk in through the cabin past seated passengers and leave for the cockpit; takeoff run in the cockpit on captain/copilot seats with shakes; passengers' scream and calm in the cabin; punchline in the cockpit. Both pilots wear the pilot uniform from the role, dark glasses and white canes.", "title": "Blind Pilots", "location": "samolet", "cast": ["muzhik", "sluzhivy", "sluzhivy-ryadovoy"], "roles": {"muzhik": "customer", "sluzhivy": "pilot", "sluzhivy-ryadovoy": "pilot"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Two blind pilots enter a plane.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "They have sunglasses and white sticks.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "As the plane starts to move, the passengers are uncomfortable.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "The plane gains speed, but it stays on the ground.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "The remaining runway gets smaller and smaller, and the plane is rushing towards a fence.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "The passengers start shrieking", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "and suddenly the plane lifts, avoiding the fence at the last second.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "All the passengers calm down, thinking it was a bad joke.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "In the pilot cabin, the co-pilot turns to the pilot and says:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "sluzhivy-ryadovoy", "text": "You know what? One day they're going to scream too late, and we're all going to die.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "samolet", "place": "cabin", "cast": ["muzhik", "sluzhivy", "sluzhivy-ryadovoy"], "roles": {"muzhik": "customer", "sluzhivy": "pilot", "sluzhivy-ryadovoy": "pilot"}, "looks": {"sluzhivy": {"add": ["dark-glasses"]}, "sluzhivy-ryadovoy": {"add": ["dark-glasses"]}}, "crowd": {"who": "passengers", "size": "many", "seated": true}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "seat-left"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "sluzhivy", "item": "white-cane", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "sluzhivy-ryadovoy", "item": "white-cane", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "move", "who": "sluzhivy", "from": "off-left", "to": "aisle-front"}, {"type": "move", "who": "sluzhivy-ryadovoy", "from": "off-left", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "camera", "shot": "two", "on": "sluzhivy"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "camera", "shot": "wide"}, {"type": "move", "who": "sluzhivy", "to": "off-right"}, {"type": "move", "who": "sluzhivy-ryadovoy", "to": "off-right"}, {"type": "shake", "sec": 3, "strength": "light"}, {"type": "crowd", "react": "murmur"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "scratch-head"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}]}, {"location": "samolet", "place": "cockpit", "transition": "cut", "cast": ["sluzhivy", "sluzhivy-ryadovoy"], "roles": {"sluzhivy": "pilot", "sluzhivy-ryadovoy": "pilot"}, "looks": {"sluzhivy": {"add": ["dark-glasses"]}, "sluzhivy-ryadovoy": {"add": ["dark-glasses"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "sluzhivy", "to": "captain"}, {"type": "move", "who": "sluzhivy-ryadovoy", "to": "copilot"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "sluzhivy", "item": "white-cane", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "sluzhivy-ryadovoy", "item": "white-cane", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "shake", "sec": 4, "strength": "light"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "shake", "sec": 5, "strength": "strong"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}]